## Suggested `.gitignore`

To keep sensitive data and large artifacts out of version control:

```gitignore
# Sensitive corpus — do NOT commit (LGPD)
dataset_balanceado_70_30.csv
*.csv
!val_predictions_no_dates.csv   # predictions only (no text) — safe to keep

# Trained model artifacts
modelo_classificador_*/
results_*/
logs_*/
```

